abstract: >
  This review synthesises the qualification frameworks, award structures,
  and regulatory expectations that shape UK higher education delivery, with 
  specific application to transnational education (TNE) in Sri Lanka. The 
  artefact pack includes all evidence logs, extraction tables, second-reader 
  verification files, and the protocol used in the structured review.

